@page "/"

<PageTitle>Reminder Web App</PageTitle>

<div class="card">
    <h1>Hit the mark 🎯</h1>
    <p>Turn your task list into a game. Break tasks into steps, set a due date, and earn points and levels for finishing on time.</p>
    <p>Missed tasks cost points, so check your dashboard every day.</p>
    <AuthorizeView>
        <Authorized><a class="btn" href="dashboard">Go to dashboard</a></Authorized>
        <NotAuthorized><a class="btn" href="login">Sign in (dev)</a></NotAuthorized>
    </AuthorizeView>
</div>
